From 945710a0910a39dc8528c28f16f34ef236f1606b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:07:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 676/676] perf(dsv41): skip dead/padding rows in extend and
 inactive segments in decode sparse_mla_fwd_v41 (#778)

Keep split_block_H (< 32, single-wave split route) branch-free at compile time so 1x2/1x3 and 1..4-row drafter steps pay zero branch overhead, while skipping dead CED rows in extend and inactive segments/rows in multi-head-block decode.
---
